Will Rock Source Reconstruction — License and Notice
====================================================

1. Reconstructed game code (src/, include/)

The code in src/ and include/ is a reconstruction of the program code of Will Rock (patch 1.2), a game developed by
Saber Interactive and published by Ubisoft in 2003. It was rebuilt function by function by studying the released
executable, for the purposes of preservation, study and interoperability.

The original game and its code are the property of their respective rights holders. No ownership of the original
work is claimed, and no rights to it are granted by this repository. The reconstructed code is shared for
non-commercial preservation and educational use only. It must not be sold or used in a commercial product.

This repository contains no game data (levels, models, textures, sounds, music or text). A copy of the game is
needed to run anything built from it.

If you are a rights holder and want this material removed, open an issue or contact the maintainer and it will be
taken down.

